[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3970211940","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116833#issuecomment-3970211940","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116833","id":3970211940,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7spKBk","user":{"login":"Geometror","id":50084500,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMDg0NTAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50084500?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror","html_url":"https://github.com/Geometror","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-27T01:34:16Z","updated_at":"2026-02-27T01:34:16Z","body":"This is a step into the right direction! We desperately need to implement this mechanism for other lengthy processes as well (such as lightmap baking), the workaround of doing manual Main iterations causes all kinds of issues (see https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104392#issuecomment-3572140913 for example).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3970211940/reactions","total_count":7,"+1":7,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4295329310","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116833#issuecomment-4295329310","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116833","id":4295329310,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAAWGHg","user":{"login":"TitanNano","id":4500858,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MDA4NTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4500858?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano","html_url":"https://github.com/TitanNano","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-22T10:08:00Z","updated_at":"2026-04-22T10:08:00Z","body":"@AThousandShips thanks for the review.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4295329310/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5647658512","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116833#issuecomment-5647658512","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116833","id":5647658512,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABUKBuEA","user":{"login":"DenisSalem","id":4476506,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NzY1MDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4476506?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenisSalem","html_url":"https://github.com/DenisSalem","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenisSalem/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenisSalem/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenisSalem/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenisSalem/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenisSalem/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenisSalem/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenisSalem/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenisSalem/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenisSalem/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-12T17:55:27Z","updated_at":"2026-09-12T19:14:59Z","body":"**TL;DR** : So far, it works as expected in the test/debug scene used for my main project. I still need to test the full integration in production for my main game project.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nOk so I finally took the time to test this one. \r\n\r\nBoth commits are working as expected in the MRP with 4.8-dev5 [9552dfb68](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/9552dfb6859a1aaba1e570b8e0ef5c599b830f19).\r\n\r\nIn my original [use case](https://forum.godotengine.org/t/voxelgi-parallel-baking/120405) I was using a sub process acting as baking server and it was working fine without negatively impact performances.\r\n\r\nThe feature proposed by @TitanNano solve my workaround by offering an elegant solution into a single process.\r\n\r\nWith this new feature I then try to bring it into a testing / debug scene from my main project. I had hard time trying to work this out because I only have two brain cells.\r\n\r\nTo not mess with the `scene` seen by the user, baking is done in a separate `Viewport` with separate resources. Once baked, `VoxelGI` is then loaded from file.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1912\" height=\"1052\" alt=\"threaded_baking_voxel_gi_will_soon_takeover_the_internet\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7b1d8764-dc0e-4254-861d-58bc26655782\" />\r\n\r\nThe above is a 50x75x46 unit volume generated in ~150 seconds from an exported binary with release template. Subdivision is `VoxelGI.SUBDIV_128`\r\n\r\nWhen running from the editor (starting a scene with `F6`), `bake()` took almost ten minutes. Not sure why. The initialization between `bake_begin()` and `bake_step()` is very long as well when running the scene from editor with `F6`. This is a bit weird since without `threaded bake()` the baking is about 40 seconds ...\r\n\r\nThe hardware is a `GTX 1060 3Go` and an `Intel Core i7 3thrd Gen`. I would say that performances are fair and quite close to what I had with my workaround. For me this is a big milestone.\r\n\r\nIt is also worth mentioning that I did not experienced stuttering in-game during baking. Stuttering is happening when VoxelGI is loaded and added to the scene which make sense since the scene is quite complex.\r\n\r\nThis is very encouraging !","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5647658512/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":3,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5657457461","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116833#issuecomment-5657457461","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116833","id":5657457461,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABUTXzNQ","user":{"login":"DenisSalem","id":4476506,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NzY1MDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4476506?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenisSalem","html_url":"https://github.com/DenisSalem","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenisSalem/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenisSalem/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenisSalem/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenisSalem/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenisSalem/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenisSalem/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenisSalem/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenisSalem/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenisSalem/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-14T00:39:09Z","updated_at":"2026-09-14T00:39:35Z","body":"@TitanNano Hello !\r\n\r\nOnce pulled in my main game, more advanced tests, show that forcing baking interruption by switching scene (Like going back to the main menu) basically crash the entire application. It's easy to imagine why: Resources are freed and yet still used for the bake.\r\n\r\n```\r\nE 0:03:28:429   get: FATAL: Index p_index = 0 is out of bounds (size() = 0).\r\n  <Source C++>  ./core/templates/cowdata.h:199 @ get()\r\n```\r\n\r\nand\r\n\r\n```\r\nE 0:03:28:564   propagate_notification: /root: The caller thread can't call the function `propagate_notification()` on this node. Use `call_deferred()` or `call_deferred_thread_group()` instead.\r\n  <Erreur C++>  Condition \"!is_accessible_from_caller_thread()\" is true.\r\n  <Source C++>  scene/main/node.cpp:2610 @ propagate_notification()\r\n```\r\n\r\nBefore this feature was implemented, one was stuck during the baking. It wasn't possible to stop or pause anything until completion. Now that the application is able do things in parallel I believe it would be useful to ship this feature with a way to interrupt the baking. There is no way to interrupt a thread with GDscript, but at the C++ level it might be possible to provide an API call like `pause()` or `cancel()` to handle situation where the baking is not required or desired anymore.\r\n\r\nWhat do you think ?","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5657457461/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5660916735","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116833#issuecomment-5660916735","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116833","id":5660916735,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABUWq7_w","user":{"login":"TitanNano","id":4500858,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MDA4NTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4500858?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano","html_url":"https://github.com/TitanNano","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-14T08:06:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-14T08:06:28Z","body":"@DenisSalem thank you for the report. I will look into it. The best solution would be to auto abort the bake process when the VoxelGI node gets freed.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5660916735/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5671211345","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116833#issuecomment-5671211345","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116833","id":5671211345,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABUgfRUQ","user":{"login":"DenisSalem","id":4476506,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NzY1MDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4476506?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenisSalem","html_url":"https://github.com/DenisSalem","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenisSalem/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenisSalem/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenisSalem/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenisSalem/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenisSalem/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenisSalem/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenisSalem/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenisSalem/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenisSalem/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-14T21:43:03Z","updated_at":"2026-09-14T21:43:03Z","body":"An extra quick report after more tests to confirm that the baking is significantly more slower during the game when threaded, compared to a baking operation made in an entirely independent unix process.\r\n\r\nThis is related to my special use case and I'm aware I'm maybe getting out of the scope of the original PR but it might worth  checking if it would be possible to also control thread priority. But right know my game is poorly optimized despite best efforts so there is definitely things I must sorts out before going further.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5671211345/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5899171540","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116833#issuecomment-5899171540","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116833","id":5899171540,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABX5421A","user":{"login":"TitanNano","id":4500858,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MDA4NTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4500858?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano","html_url":"https://github.com/TitanNano","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-29T21:21:38Z","updated_at":"2026-09-29T21:21:38Z","body":"@DenisSalem I have significantly refactored this PR to be thread-safe and to auto-cancel the VoxelGI bake process if the node gets freed. \r\n\r\nPlease let me know what results you get once you've tested it.\r\n\r\n--- \r\n\r\n> An extra quick report after more tests to confirm that the baking is significantly more slower during the game when threaded, compared to a baking operation made in an entirely independent unix process.\r\n\r\nAre you running some tasks on the `WorkerThreadPool` in your project? That could be interfering with the VoxelGI baking. \r\n\r\nThere is a flag to make the bake task high priority on the `WorkerThreadPool`, if you have some other competing tasks, we can consider setting that flag and see if it improves things for you. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5899171540/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]